{"slug":"The-Strongest-Battlegrounds-Fe-Gojo-Six-Eyes-Moveset-33368","_id":"67e61ed15c52cc24dec95ef6","title":"Fe Gojo Six Eyes Moveset (MOBILE PORT)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d29","gameId":10449761463,"name":"The Strongest Battlegrounds","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-c947df5b221c30672c3591247a8c6495-d88fb8427541.png","placeId":10449761463},"features":"( THIS IS THE MOBILE VERSION ! )\n\nIt has 3 Different Unique Base Movesets,\n\nUpdate Logs 2X\n(\nADDED CURSED ENERGY (WHEN FILLED CHANGES THE ULT WITH NEW SKILLS + TO RAISE YOUR CURSED ENERGY YOU MUST GET AN KILL, WHICH THEN WILL ADD +1 TO THE CURSED ENERGY. (CURSED ENERGY MUST BE 5 TO BE FULL)\n\nCURSED ENERGY ULT MOVESET SKILLS :\n1 - Fractured Skull\n2 - Maximum Output: Red\n3 - Imaginary Purple\n\nEXTRA SETTINGS :\nADDED AN SETTING TO MAKE YOU'RE CURSED ENERGY START AT 3/5\nALL CHAT LINES WILL NO LONGER START ENABLED\n\n[ 2x of the update ]\nNEW ANIMATIONS TOGGLE SETTING (CHANGES IDLE, WALK, RUN, JUMP, FALL ANIMS) \n\nCLIENT SIDED GOJO MORPH/CHARACTER TOGGLE SETTING (BEST USED WITH NEW ANIMS SETTING)\n\n)\n\nYou must be using The Strongest Hero.\n\nIt has a Unique amount of combo extender combos you can do, things like the third move into lapse blue, to then m1 into a down slam.\n\nif you encounter any bugs while using any of these Executors: Xeno, Code X, Velocity Please report it to the Discord Server Support Channel and tag it with Bug Report","tags":["Gojo","Six Eyes","The Strongest Battlegrounds","TSB","Death Port"],"script":"-- ( THIS IS THE MOBILE EDITION, WILL NOT GET UPDATES. )\ngetgenv().FatalCombatSkillLayout = true -- ( Doesnt work on every device.. )\ngetgenv().MovesetReachSound = true -- [ PLAYS AN SOUND WHEN YOU FILL AN SECTION OF THE ULT BAR. ]\ngetgenv().CharacterOnList = true --[ adds script to the character list ]\n-- [ [ CUTSCENE TOGGLES ] ]\ngetgenv().AwakeningUpTiltCutscene = true\n-- [ [ CHAT LINE TOGGLES ] ]\ngetgenv().ReversalRedChatLine = false --[ adds an chat line for the first move of the second / third moveset]\ngetgenv().ReversalTechniqueRedChatLine = false --[ adds an chat line for the fourth move of the third moveset]\ngetgenv().AwakenChatLine = false --[ adds chat lines when you awaken ]\ngetgenv().MaximumPurpleChatLine = false --[ adds chat lines when you use Maximum Purple ]\ngetgenv().HollowPurpleChatLine = false --[ adds chat lines when you use Hollow Purple ]\n-- [ [ CHARACTER TOGGLES ] ]\ngetgenv().GojoCharacter = true --[ MAKES IT SO YOU HAVE AN CLIENT SIDED GOJO DESIGN ]\ngetgenv().NewAnimations = true --[ MAKES IT SO YOU HAVE NEW ANIMS FOR IDLE ETC (BEST USED WITH BLOCKY / 1.0 CHARACTER) ]\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/SonicexePort/c2c90da0c63506c5872ba10983c4b73d/raw/bd3e7657d4b1e222ed376419ec3fb4f9aabd176c/Six%2520Eyes%2520Mobile%2520Port%2520(CURSED%2520ENERGY!)'))()","owner":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67af269724d76538a5a97323-1767021867316.png","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.com/invite/FMxRhhVfXu","views":52485,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/10449761463-1743134417020.png","likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-03-28T04:00:17.076Z","editBy":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323"},"executes":1975,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e61ed15c52cc24dec95ef8","editBy":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-28T04:00:17.081Z"},{"_id":"67e61fcfad904c6d0d50439e","editBy":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323"}